  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Givarnas arbetsgrupp f&#xf6;r privatsektorutveckling och handel (PSD&amp;T SWG)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private sector devlopment &amp; trade sector working group (PSD&amp;T SWG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser frist&#xe5;ende support till en utav de arbetsgrupper under Development Assistance Group (DAG) i Etiopien. Supporten har avsikt att dra nytta av ny expertis genom anv&#xe4;ndandet av utvalda konsulter som hj&#xe4;lper gruppen med att utveckla rapporter och planera workshops som driver gruppens arbete fram&#xe5;t.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution concerns free-standing support to one of the sector working group under the Development Assistance Group (DAG) in Ethiopia. The support is aimed to bring in external expertise in the form of consultants to support the development of reports and planning of workshops to drive the working group&apos;s agenda forward.</narrative>
  </description>
